Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=72}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:07.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Waa! My hat! Where's my hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:09.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's right there, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh good, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have a good nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... Those pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:16.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gone now,\Nall thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah, and Ghin asked me to tell you\Nthat he said, "See you on the Grand Line."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:25.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh, he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To {\i1}you{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.55,0:02:33.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, I guess I don't have to\Ndo anymore lame-o chores,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,since I got those pirates\Noff your back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:37.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:41.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not gonna run away\Nwith you to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.64,0:02:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got some unfinished business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:48.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll stay until Zeff\Nacknowledges my skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:50.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:51.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means you let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:57.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:01.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These bozos don't know the first\Nthing about how to run a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:05.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But still, I promised myself\Nthat one of these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:13.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It just isn't the right time. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:17.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, have you ever\Nheard of the All Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sea is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:30.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the All Blue, there are fish\Nfrom the East Blue, the West Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:32.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the North Blue, and the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:35.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That one stretch of ocean has it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:36.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To us cooks, it's a\Nculinary dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:43.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A place that fantastic has got to be\Non the Grand Line somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, where else...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:51.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The little brat looks truly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:02.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, guys! Soup's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:13.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh good, they saved us some seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No chairs left for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just sit on the floor and eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are no chairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:31.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They sure are acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunch of jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:38.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who prepared the soup this morning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:41.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This stuff is pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I really out did myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:50.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can barely hold this\Nslop down! Bleh! Bleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:57.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought someone\Nlike you, would like slop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It makes sense to me, seeing\Nas, that's what pigs like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:05.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Just face it Sanji, your\Nsoup sucks. It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bleh, bleh, bleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That soup is nothing\Nshort of a delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nwith your taste buds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh! That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:24.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bleh, bleh! Revolting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This soup is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going\Non, you bastards?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're sick of the way you run things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a sham of a Sous Chef\Nand everybody knows it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:47.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't just settle every single\Nlittle disagreement with violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the food's bad,\Nthen we're gonna say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That wretched little dish\Ntasted like stewed garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:09.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we ever served that kind of trash\Nhere, we'd go out of business!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you really this stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just how is my soup any different\Nfrom the stuff you make? How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:16.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think they're the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:22.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Boss punched him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:26.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He didn't kick him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:30.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think you can lecture me\Non the art of cooking, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fat chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:35.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm a man who has cooked on more seas\Nthan days that you've been alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:41.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah! What's all the fuss about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This soup's totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of us know the soup is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:59.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know he's an outstanding chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:02.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone here on the Baratie does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:06.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aside from Chef Zeff,\Nhe's the best we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was scary wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:09.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He seriously snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:21.50,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But that thick-skulled idiot wouldn't\Nlisten to us if we tried to reason with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:24.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:26.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:29.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were saying that you needed\Na cook for your ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:32.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't something I\Nwant to be asking anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but... would you mind taking\Nthat little brat along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take him to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:40.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That would be best for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:44.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:49.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geez, Boss, you sure made\Nus put on a hell of a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:53.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I was worried he was gonna\Nfigure it out 'cause of your bad acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, your acting was\Nway worse than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:59.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get\Nsome more of that soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that stuff is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:19.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can hear everything, Dumbasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:23.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say, Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:24.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But earlier, you mentioned you\Nneeded a cook for your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:32.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That he's suddenly not\Ngood enough for ya'?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:40.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'd love it if he joined\Nmy crew and came with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But, it seems like he really wants to stay\Nhere and cook with all of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:48.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can ask me all you want,\Nbut I'm just not gonna take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So you're saying you can't agree to it\Nuntil he tells you himself, s'that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! More food, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that's fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:02.48,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But, who knows if that hardheaded little\Nbrat will ever agree to join up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:07.49,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah, once that guy makes up his mind,\Nthere's nothin' anybody can do to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:08.78,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,More, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:40.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that? A fishman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he come all the\Nway from the Fishman Islands
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– to eat here?\N– You dolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a human and a panshark!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:47.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:49.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's Yosaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey... Big Bro Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come you're alone?\NWhere are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you find Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:06.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We never actually caught up to her,\Nbut, from the direction Big Sis is headed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we think we've figured out where\Nshe's going and what she plans to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:13.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see...\NThen we can bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe... It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:17.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,IF our suspicions turn out to be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then the place she intends to\Ngo could mean certain death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for all of us, if we follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The point is, we really\Nneed your help, Big Bro Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:26.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay... I don't really get it,\Nbut I got it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:42.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your dream is foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then again, so's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now is as good a time as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why not start my quest, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:56.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.26,0:11:00.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'll be joining your little crew,\Non your journey to be King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want to be the cook on your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right? What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is great, Big Bro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:13.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Woo hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:14.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got a cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we'll get the tasty food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got a cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:21.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you guys happy now, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Really, I'll leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! I don't like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To tell ya' the truth, I was\Nhopin' to give you the boot
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from this restaurant personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But, it seems that you don't have\Na problem with straight up abandoning us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:38.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm especially sorry for making\Nthe lot of you resort to bad acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bunch of jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was stomping on my pride the best\Nplan that you could come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:48.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every little thing has\Nto be a fight with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sick and tired of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hmph. I never have liked children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I hate children.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There wasn't a day passed\Nwhen I didn't regret
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,letting a useless little\Nbrat like you live, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:10.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Fine by me, you rotten old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:13.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the rest of your miserable life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:15.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is a nice ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure it's okay to use her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! It's Sanji's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still need more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yup! Gonna need more meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:26.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, well how many days\Nare you gonna be out at sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:27.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:34.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the nicest sea\Nrestaurant I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:35.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:02.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:06.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what sort\Nof person walks through our doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:07.39,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If they're hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:10.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Then they will be fed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:14.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Every starving wretch who comes\Nto us will get a fine meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:16.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We can make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:20.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how much we fight,\Nbecause we share the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:22.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause we're gonna be busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You bet! It won't be\Na problem with me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:39.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:47.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what you call peeling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.97,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.97,0:13:50.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to cook here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:54.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stay outta my way, and we\Nwon't have any problems! Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You better watch your\Nmouth, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:14:02.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1854)}I'm not a little brat,\Nyou crusty old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! Try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:08.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you make it all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:09.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the worst soup I've\Never had, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.21,0:14:17.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean, old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Cook\Nsure is taking his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:43.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, it's payback time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:54.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really guys, that was just dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't need to say goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chef Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I owe my life to you, Old Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:07.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:12.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:17.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:41.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn wusses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:45.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Real men should part without\Na word, let alone tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:51.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:55.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will see you again!\NI'll come back someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Bye!\N– Bye, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:10.97,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,As long as you sail with\Nenough faith in yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:14.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,that you have no fear...\Nnot even of death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:17.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You will find the All Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:19.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.65,0:17:22.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:25.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Customers will be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get to work already!
Comment: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:04.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=73}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=70}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
